sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CLI
    participant SDK as KVClient / SDK
    participant Topo
    participant Leader as Storage Leader
    participant Peers as Storage Followers / Raft Peers
    participant StateMachine as KvStateMachine

    User->>SDK: put(db, table, key, value)
    SDK->>SDK: RouteCache lookup by key

    alt route missing or stale
        SDK->>Topo: GetTableRoutes(db, table)
        Topo-->>SDK: table routes
    end

    SDK->>Leader: Put(replica_id, key, value)
    Leader->>Leader: ReplicaManager finds Replica
    Leader->>Leader: Replica::put -> ProposeCall
    Leader->>Peers: AppendEntries
    Peers-->>Leader: AppendEntriesResponse
    Leader->>Leader: quorum commit
    Leader-->>SDK: OK / UNKNOWN / NOT_LEADER
    SDK-->>User: response
    Leader->>StateMachine: apply committed log
